    "heading": "A company for the Serewater March",
    "text": "Three settlements share the March and, under Censer Hill, their dead: Reedwake on the river, Chalkcross on the downs, Brackenholt across the water. A surveyor is missing under the hill this morning. Choose three companions; their ancestry, calling and background decide what they can do, and what doors open."
